{"title":"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/4/cc432afff56b1f3579795a66038bf6e55ffe8b57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9210 - 9124 = 210 - \\boxed { }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />, the value represented by the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/b/febf4307ef5db5cad13686c742d8a3c43eb2a1cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed { }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e44d8f7262b1868990e5ab7bbdbd9d947ca3488.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 296 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 210 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 186 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 124 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number represented by the box. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/3/323c121c1061d7f03b556f6f271b3671620bf210.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9210 - 9124 = 210 - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"181\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/7/1375477599d0cdabe317f2d7f0d6f800dcaa9088.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$86 = 210 - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/f/8ef3838d943871752699440a18fe5966bd32d215.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 210 - 86$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/8/3f8e160f3e5c0c3ec292f1d3a9bc03d73eefac6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 124}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"111\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can notice that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/2/d22eda65bd449382dff20ef7a7f33c4f00601da5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9210 = 9000 + 210$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/5/91529d70f56e608d93265e9f8aec78631dbb086f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9124 = 9000 + 124$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Thus, when subtracting the two, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/9/6e94e2da9c554d400b411e9c0fd1f0c2c13ef670.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9000$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />s cancel out, leaving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/a/06a5bd93dc7abf7a4278480a726b602c71f9b9a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$210 - 124$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>This means that the number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/2/f82f7c4b483731890248770ffd60d53e5df57d3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 124}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />, since we have the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/9/f599c18dd8daddabcbe9dce87335f2cbbb65eb91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$210 - \\boxed { }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"63\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?tit